    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header provides the inline member function bodies for the <computeroutput>runner_options</computeroutput> class, separated from the class declaration in <computeroutput><ref refid="runner-options_8h" kindref="compound">runner-options.h</ref></computeroutput> to enforce the project convention that declarations reside in headers and implementations reside in inline files.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus</ref></computeroutput> namespace, ensuring clear separation from user code and minimising the risk of naming conflicts. </para>
